    {
      "v": 8,
      "zh": "这律法书不可离开你的口，总要昼夜思想，好使你谨守遵行这书上所写的一切话。如此，你的道路就可以亨通，凡事顺利。",
      "en": "This law scroll must not leave your lips.[NOTE:1] You must memorize it[NOTE:2] day and night so you can carefully obey[NOTE:3] all that is written in it. Then you will prosper[NOTE:4] and be successful.[NOTE:5]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “mouth.”sn This law scroll must not leave your lips. The ancient practice of reading aloud to oneself as an aid to memorization is in view here.",
